@overheard garden
// Writer-commons, overheard batch 2. The hydroponics garden: gardeners, and anyone sitting among the plants.

== overheard
? pair:garden+garden act:work place:hydroponics_garden
A: Week nine lettuces are ready.
B: Week nine already?
A: They grow up so fast.   #funny

? pair:garden+any place:hydroponics_garden
A: Can I pick a tomato?
B: On harvest day.
A: Just a small one?
B: They're all small. That's the point.   #funny

? pair:any+garden place:hydroponics_garden
A: Why's it so warm in here?
B: Tomatoes like it warm.
A: So do I.
B: Then you can stay.   #warm

? pair:garden+garden time:morning place:hydroponics_garden
A: Misters are on.
B: Smells like rain.
A: Don't tell Dlamini. He'll move in.   #funny

? pair:any+any act:leisure place:hydroponics_garden
A: I come in here when it's busy out there.
B: Me too. Plants don't ask questions.
A: They do listen, though.

? pair:garden+any place:hydroponics_garden
A: Who left a cactus by the beans?
B: That's Gerald. He's visiting.   #funny
